    <div class="founders-story-body">
      <p>For co-founders Jaxon Cummings and Jonny Schmidt, this work isn't abstract history. Jaxon's grandfather and both grandmothers lived directly in the path of the Nevada nuclear tests, and his father passed away from cancer in 2023. Jonny discovered the RECA program while searching for resources to help his mother following a terminal cancer diagnosis.</p>
      <p>Experiencing first-hand how daunting it is to track down decades-old records from county archives, school districts, and hospitals, they founded Downwinders Advocates to give families dedicated support from first review through federal approval.</p>
    </div>
