        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Independent and dedicated advocacy.</strong>
            <p class="muted">When a claim requires formal legal proceedings or representation, we coordinate directly with licensed counsel like our partner attorney.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <strong>Your records are yours.</strong>
            <p class="muted">We tell you what we collect and why. Request deletion or return of your file at any time. We never sell or share your private information.</p>
